    "identifier": "hanami-hanami-style-healing-cloak",
    "description": "<p>Your entire body is covered in soothing medical chakra as you begin to glow a soft pink. When you cast this jutsu you regain 3d8 hit points.</p>\n<p>Also, for the duration, each time you take damage, you gain a 1 Hanami Resilience. At the beginning of your turn, you regain 1d8 hit points for each Hanami Resilience you have, and then set your Hanami Resilience to 0.</p>\n<p>Monstrous Burst. For the duration, each time you score two or more melee attacks in the same turn, you also gain 1 Hanami Resilience.</p>\n<p>Healers Touch. Select a damage type. For the duration, once per turn, each time you take damage from the chosen type, you gain 2 Hanami Resilience.</p>",
